                                        24/7.
                                    </p>
                                    <div class="call-buttons d-flex gap-5 flex-wrap">
                                        <a href="tel:+919689528414" class="btn book-btn">📞 Book Your Appointment</a>
                                        <a href="tel:+919689528414" class="btn emergency-btn">🚨 Emergency Helpline</a>
