    <div class="rts-about-area rts-section-gapBottom mt-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-5">
                    <div class="about-image-left-wrapper">
                        <div class="thumbnail-main move-right wow">
                            <img src="assets/group-2.jpg" alt="about" style="border-radius: 22px" class="group-img"
                                loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6 offset-lg-1 mt--30">
                    <div class="about-content-wrapper-right">
                        <div class="title-wrapper-left">
                            <h2 class="title wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay=".4s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                                About Gore Multispeciality Hospital
                            </h2>
                        </div>
                        <p class="disc wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay=".4s" data-wow-duration=".8s"
                            style="color: #555555; font-size: 18px; max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            At <strong>Gore Multispeciality Hospital</strong>, we believe that excellent healthcare is
                            not just about advanced machines and medicines—it’s also about care, respect, and
                            understanding. Recognised as a leading multispeciality hospital, we are proud to be a
                            trusted healthcare partner for families across the region.<br><br>
                            Our hospital was built with a clear vision: to bring high-quality medical services under one
                            roof, close to home. Today, we offer advanced treatments across multiple specialities,
                            supported by modern diagnostic facilities and 24/7 emergency care.<br><br>
                            Every patient is different, and so are their needs. That’s why we focus on personalised
                            treatment that respects your health concerns, culture, and family values. Whether you come
                            to us for a simple consultation, a preventive health check-up, or a complex surgery, our
                            experienced doctors and caring staff make sure you receive the right treatment in a safe and
                            supportive environment.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-area position-relative rts-section-gapBottom mt--50">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row g-5 justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12">
                    <div class="title-wrapper-left text-center mx-auto">
                        <h2 class="title wow fadeInUp text-center" data-wow-delay=".4s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                            Our Heart Services Under One Roof
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="assets/cardiology-heart.jpg" alt="Heart Checkups & Tests" class="img-fluid"
                                loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
                            <h4 class="service-card-title">1. Heart Checkups & Tests</h4>
                            <p class="service-card-text">
                                Keeping your heart healthy starts with regular checkups. At Gore Multispeciality
                                Hospital, we offer ECG,
                                ECHO, stress tests, and Holter monitoring to make sure your heart is in top shape. It’s
                                simple, thorough,
                                and gives you peace of mind about your heart’s health.
                            </p>
                            <a href="/services/cardiology.html" class="service-card-link">
                                Learn More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.4s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="assets/cardiology.jpg" alt="Interventional Cardiology" class="img-fluid"
                                loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
                            <h4 class="service-card-title">2. Interventional Cardiology</h4>
                            <p class="service-card-text">
                                If there’s a blockage or a rhythm issue, our team is ready to help. We perform advanced
                                procedures like
                                angioplasty, stent placement, and pacemaker implantations. We use minimally invasive
                                techniques so you
                                can recover faster and get back to your life.
                            </p>
                            <a href="/services/cardiology.html" class="service-card-link">
                                Learn More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.6s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="assets/machine-one.jpg" alt="Heart Surgeries" class="img-fluid" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
                            <h4 class="service-card-title">3. Heart Surgeries</h4>
                            <p class="service-card-text">
                                For complex heart conditions, our expert surgeons provide life-saving treatments like
                                CABG (bypass surgery)
                                and valve repairs. We combine advanced technology with a personal touch to ensure the
                                best possible
                                outcome for you and your family.
                            </p>
                            <a href="/services/cardiology.html" class="service-card-link">
                                Learn More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.8s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="assets/cardiology.png" alt="Preventive Cardiology" class="img-fluid"
                                loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
                            <h4 class="service-card-title">4. Preventive Cardiology</h4>
                            <p class="service-card-text">
                                The best way to treat a heart problem is to stop it before it starts. We provide guided
                                lifestyle changes,
                                diet plans, and risk assessments to help you manage blood pressure and cholesterol,
                                keeping your heart
                                strong for years to come.
                            </p>
                            <a href="/services/cardiology.html" class="service-card-link">
                                Learn More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="images/indian_emergency_stretcher_1769163615573.png" alt="Emergency Cardiac Care"
                                class="img-fluid" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
                            <h4 class="service-card-title">5. Emergency Cardiac Care</h4>
                            <p class="service-card-text">
                                Heart emergencies don’t wait, and neither do we. Our 24/7 cardiac emergency unit is
                                always ready to
                                handle chest pain, heart attacks, and other critical situations. With our dedicated
                                Cardiac ICU, you’re
                                in safe hands every second.
                            </p>
                            <a href="/services/cardiology.html" class="service-card-link">
                                Learn More <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-long"></i>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-area rts-section-gapBottom">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-12">
                    <div class="title-wrapper-left text-center mx-auto mb--50">
                        <h2 class="title wow fadeInUp text-center">Heart Problems We Treat</h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="assets/top-warning-signs-of-heart-and-lung-disease.png" alt="Chest Pain"
                                class="img-fluid" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
                            <h4 class="service-card-title">Chest Pain</h4>
                            <p class="service-card-text">
                                We carefully evaluate chest pain to identify heart-related causes and provide timely
                                treatment.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.4s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="assets/machine-two.jpg" alt="High Blood Pressure" class="img-fluid"
                                loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
                            <h4 class="service-card-title">High Blood Pressure</h4>
                            <p class="service-card-text">
                                Our doctors help control high blood pressure through proper diagnosis, medicines, and
                                lifestyle guidance.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.6s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="assets/cardiology.jpg" alt="Heart Attack" class="img-fluid" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
                            <h4 class="service-card-title">Heart Attack</h4>
                            <p class="service-card-text">
                                We provide fast and effective emergency treatment for heart attacks to reduce damage.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.8s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="assets/cardiology-heart.jpg" alt="Blocked Arteries" class="img-fluid"
                                loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
                            <h4 class="service-card-title">Blocked Arteries</h4>
                            <p class="service-card-text">
                                We treat blocked arteries using advanced tests and procedures to improve blood flow.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s" data-wow-duration=".8s">
                    <div class="service-card hospital-card">
                        <div class="service-card-image">
                            <img src="assets/card.png" alt="Irregular Heartbeat" class="img-fluid" loading="lazy">
                        </div>
                        <div class="service-card-body">
