    <div class="service-details rts-section-gap">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="title text-center mb--40">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                        <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#c1">
                            1. Which is the best cardiology hospital in Pradhikaran?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="c1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            The best cardiology hospital is one that has experienced heart doctors, modern testing
                            facilities, and emergency care available at all times. At <strong>Gore Multispeciality
                                Hospital</strong>, the focus is also on patient comfort and clear communication, so
                            people understand their condition and treatment without confusion.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#c2">
                            2. What tests are done for heart problems?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="c2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Doctors usually suggest tests like ECG, 2D Echo, TMT, and blood tests to understand how your
                            heart is working. These tests help find blockages, rhythm problems, or weak heart muscles
                            and guide the doctor in choosing the right treatment.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#c3">
                            3. Is chest pain always related to heart disease?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="c3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Chest pain is not always caused by heart problems. It can also happen due to gas, muscle
                            strain, or anxiety. However, since heart-related chest pain can be dangerous, it is always
                            safer to consult a doctor and get proper evaluation.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#c4">
                            4. What is angiography and why is it done?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="c4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Angiography is a special test that helps doctors see if there are blockages in the heart’s
                            blood vessels. It is done when a person has chest pain or other symptoms of heart disease,
                            so doctors can decide the best treatment option.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#c5">
                            5. Do you provide emergency heart care?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="c5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Yes, emergency heart care is available round the clock for patients with chest pain, heart
                            attack symptoms, or sudden breathing difficulty. Quick testing and treatment during an
                            emergency can save lives, which is why emergency cardiac care is very important.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq6">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#c6">
                            6. What are the symptoms of a heart attack?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="c6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Common heart attack symptoms include chest pain or pressure, pain in the left arm or jaw,
                            shortness of breath, sweating, nausea, and sudden weakness. Some people may also feel
                            dizziness or extreme tiredness. Any of these signs need immediate medical attention.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq7">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#c7">
                            7. What causes heart blockage?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="c7" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Heart blockage usually happens when cholesterol and fat build up inside the blood vessels
                            over many years. This is often linked to unhealthy eating, lack of exercise, smoking,
                            obesity, diabetes, and stress. Over time, this buildup reduces blood flow to the heart.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="accordion-item">
                    <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq8">
                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#c8">
                            8. Do heart problems affect young people?
                        </button>
                    </h2>
                    <div id="c8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                        <div class="accordion-body">
                            Yes, heart problems can affect young people too. Stress, poor diet, smoking, lack of
                            exercise, obesity, and family history can increase risk even at a young age. That is why
                            young adults should also pay attention to heart health and lifestyle habits.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

